# Smile.io

> Smile is the loyalty platform for Shopify Plus and enterprise brands. Points, VIP tiers and referrals, built natively for Shopify: checkout, customer accounts, Shopify POS and Klaviyo.

Proof: SOC 2 Type II (audited May 2026). Built for Shopify: Shopify's highest quality certification for apps. Certified Technology Partner: Shopify's enterprise-readiness certification. 2026 Build Award winner. 4.9 on the Shopify App Store.

## Platform

- [Points](https://smile.io/points): Reward buying, sharing and coming back
- [VIP tiers](https://smile.io/vip): Tiers with better rewards and perks
- [Bonus events](https://smile.io/features/loyalty-bonus-campaigns-results): Time-bound bonus points and multipliers
- [Subscriptions](https://smile.io/features/subscriptions): Points on every recurring order
- [Referrals](https://smile.io/referrals): Word of mouth as a measurable channel
- [Shopify](https://smile.io/shopify): Loyalty at every stop in Shopify
- [Loyalty Hub](https://smile.io/features/loyalty-hub): Rewards inside Shopify customer accounts
- [Checkout extensions](https://smile.io/shopify-plus): Redeem points right at checkout
- [Loyalty landing page](https://smile.io/features/loyalty-landing-page): A branded page, published in one click
- [Shopify POS](https://smile.io/features/shopify-pos): One balance online and in store
- [Klaviyo email and SMS](https://smile.io/klaviyo): Points, tiers and referral links in every flow
- [Multi-language](https://smile.io/features/multi-language): 20+ languages, zero setup
- [Analytics](https://smile.io/features/analytics): Six dashboards and 25+ reports
- [Loyalty benchmarks](https://smile.io/features/loyalty-benchmarks): Compare with stores of your size and industry
- [Headless and JS SDK](https://smile.io/features/headless): Any headless storefront, including Hydrogen
- [Integrations](https://smile.io/integrations): More than 25 partners have built integrations

